#: ../../reference/faq.md:1
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Frequently asked questions"

#: ../../reference/faq.md:3
msgid "**为什么拒绝非 SI 单位？**"
msgstr "**Why are non-SI units rejected?**"

#: ../../reference/faq.md:5
msgid "v0.1 只消费规范 SI 源文件。把非 SI 导出通过确定性、经过评审的预处理步骤转换，保留原始文件和转换记录，再导入转换后的文件。改列名不是单位转换。"
msgstr "v0.1 consumes canonical SI artifacts only. Convert non-SI exports through a deterministic, reviewed preprocessing step, keep the original files and conversion records, and import the converted artifacts. Renaming a column is not a unit conversion."

#: ../../reference/faq.md:7
msgid "**输出目录已经存在，能覆盖吗？**"
msgstr "**Can I overwrite an existing output directory?**"

#: ../../reference/faq.md:9
msgid "不能。导出到新的空目录。便携包恰好包含六个文件，任何多余或改动的成员都会让校验失败。"
msgstr "No. Export to a new empty directory. A portable package contains exactly six files, and any extra or modified member fails validation."

#: ../../reference/faq.md:11
msgid "**动态几何环境能省略导体几何吗？**"
msgstr "**Can a dynamic-geometry environment omit conductor geometry?**"

#: ../../reference/faq.md:13
msgid "不能。动态包必须包含完整路径、贡献和框架；不存在固定矩阵回退或最近位姿插值。"
msgstr "No. Dynamic packages must contain complete paths, contributions, and frames; there is no fixed-matrix fallback or nearest-pose interpolation."

#: ../../reference/faq.md:15
msgid "**这个项目会训练策略吗？**"
msgstr "**Does this project train policies?**"

#: ../../reference/faq.md:17
msgid "不会。它只构建和加载 Gymnasium 环境；训练、评估和策略发布都在项目边界之外。"
msgstr "No. It only builds and loads Gymnasium environments; training, evaluation, and policy publication are outside the project boundary."

#: ../../reference/faq.md:19
msgid "**错误输出怎么读？**"
msgstr "**How do I read error output?**"

#: ../../reference/faq.md:21
msgid "命令在 stdout 输出一个 JSON 信封，失败时 `error` 里有 `type`、`subtype`、`message` 和 `hint`。先读 `ok` 字段，再按 `hint` 修复源头。"
msgstr "Commands write one JSON envelope on stdout; on failure, `error` carries `type`, `subtype`, `message`, and `hint`. Read `ok` first, then fix the source as `hint` directs."

#: ../../reference/faq.md:23
msgid "**文档和 `--help` 不一致时以谁为准？**"
msgstr "**When docs and `--help` disagree, which wins?**"

#: ../../reference/faq.md:25
msgid "以 `--help` 为准。本站故意不复制命令参数；如果发现本站引用了不存在的 flag，请提 issue 或 PR 修正。"
msgstr "`--help` wins. This site intentionally does not duplicate command parameters; if you find a flag here that does not exist, file an issue or open a PR."

#: ../../reference/faq.md:27
msgid "**我想给文档提 PR，需要满足什么？**"
msgstr "**What do I need to satisfy when contributing to the docs?**"

#: ../../reference/faq.md:29
msgid "中文是事实源，英文是翻译；命令细节进 `--help`，设计思想进 `docs/`，工作流进 `skills/`。CI 会以警告即失败、linkcheck 和示例可复现作为门禁。"
msgstr "Chinese is the source of truth and English is the translation; command details belong in `--help`, design ideas in `docs/`, workflows in `skills/`. CI gates on warnings-as-errors, linkcheck, and reproducible examples."
